WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.580
[BOTH scream]

3
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.370
[Luffy groans]

4
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.610
You're officially under
ship arrest, Captain!

5
00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:19.210
I'm sorry. I... I goofed up.

6
00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.550
You did more than
that, you idiot!

7
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.710
You could've killed
your whole crew!

8
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.600
[all screaming]

9
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.310
[Luffy yelling]

10
00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.710
How can you be so stupid?

11
00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.850
[Nami growls]

12
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.300
[Jinbe laughs]

13
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.920
Well, we all made it
out all right, didn't we?

14
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.140
That's all that matters!

15
00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:42.840
[NAMI] What was that?

16
00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.460
Are you going easy
on him, Jinbe?

17
00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.290
[Jinbe gasps]

18
00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.240
Is that...

19
00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.900
conqueror's haki?

20
00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.750
It's not worth it, Boss!

21
00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.230
Back away, soldier.

22
00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.620
You're in the blast zone!

23
00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.280
Huh? All done?

24
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.330
You patched things
up so quickly!

25
00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.670
Yep! Thanks to the Sunny!

26
00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.730
She's tough!

27
00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:06.650
Took that fall like
a total champ!

28
00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:07.540
[Luffy yells]

29
00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:08.260
Only broke a yard, in fact!

30
00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.400
Not too shabby!

31
00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:12.250
Captain sure put 'er through
her paces, though!

32
00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.230
[both gasp]

33
00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:15.740
[stomach gurgles]

34
00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:14.610
[chuckles]

35
00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:17.250
Robin, dear!

36
00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.340
Your snack is here.

37
00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:23.160
Why, thank you.

38
00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.330
Oh.

39
00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:27.570
[gasps]

40
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.980
Our wanted posters.

41
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.040
They're all new.

42
00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:36.900
[SANJI] Wanted posters?

43
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.110
Can I see?

44
00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:39.340
Please?

45
00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:45.270
[Robin gasps]

46
00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:44.810
[gasps]

47
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.670
<b>New Emperors</b>

48
00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:50.370
[NARRATOR]
An Emperor of the Sea.

49
00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.950
And the senior captain
of the Straw Hat Fleet,

50
00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:57.310
Straw Hat Luffy and his nine crewmates are
now some of the most important players

51
00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:58.690
in the world of pirates.

52
00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:01.770
It's only natural that
their bounties would change.

53
00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:06.310
I'm sorry.

54
00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:10.030
Did it go up?

55
00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:13.200
[grunts]

56
00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:24.830
<b>"Cotton Candy Lover" Chopper
Ship's Doctor (Pet)</b>
<b>Bounty: 1,000
(Up by 900)</b>

57
00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:20.360
[NARRATOR] The ship's doctor, Cotton
Candy Lover Chopper, listed as a pet.

58
00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.800
Bounty: 1,000 berries.

59
00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:24.830
Up by 900 berries.

60
00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.230
Hey!

61
00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:29.000
Is this some kind of joke?!

62
00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.380
Huh?

63
00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.880
[screams]

64
00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:40.520
[NARRATOR]
Navigator, Cat Burglar Nami.

65
00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.820
[gasps]

66
00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:44.940
<b>Bounty: 366 Million</b>
<b>"Cat Burglar" Nami
Navigator</b>

67
00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.300
Bounty: 366 million berries.

68
00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.120
Why?

69
00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.510
Why can't I have that money?

70
00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.860
Yeah, baby!

71
00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:05.290
<b>"Soul King" Brook
Musician</b>
<b>Bounty: 383 Million</b>

72
00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:01.450
[NARRATOR]
Musician, Soul King Brook.

73
00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:05.400
Bounty: 383 million berries.

74
00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.280
[BROOK] Thank you!

75
00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:07.810
[FRANKY] What?

76
00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:19.800
<b>"Iron Man" Franky
Shipwright</b>
<b>Bounty: 394 Million</b>

77
00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.650
[NARRATOR]
Shipwright, Cyborg Franky.

78
00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:18.620
Bounty: 394 million berries.

79
00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:20.140
<b>"Iron Man" Franky
Shipwright</b>
<b>Bounty: 394 Million</b>

80
00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.050
Those government bastards!

81
00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.640
Where the hell am I?

82
00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.560
[gasps]

83
00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:32.440
[wails]

84
00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.420
I don't know!

85
00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:37.450
<b>"God" Usopp
Marksman</b>
<b>Bounty: 500 Million</b>

86
00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.490
[NARRATOR]
Sniper, God Usopp.

87
00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:37.600
Bounty: 500 million berries.

88
00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.560
Enough!

89
00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:41.120
I don't want it
to go up anymore!

90
00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.130
This should cheer you up.

91
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:45.010
Don't be sad.

92
00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:53.960
<b>"Devil Child" Nico Robin
Archaeologist</b>
<b>Bounty: 930 Million</b>

93
00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.800
[NARRATOR] Archaeologist,
Demon Child Nico Robin.

94
00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.070
Bounty: 930 million berries.

95
00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:55.850
[Chopper laughs]

96
00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:56.500
Oh, boy!

97
00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.040
Thank you!

98
00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.990
[Robin chuckles]

99
00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.660
[chuckles]

100
00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:09.230
<b>"Black Leg" Sanji
Cook</b>
<b>Bounty: 1.032 Billion</b>

101
00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.320
[NARRATOR]
Cook, Blackleg Sanji.

102
00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:09.180
Bounty:
1,032,000,000 berries.

103
00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.780
[ZORO] Jinbe, here's yours.

104
00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:13.710
[JINBE] Oh!

105
00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.260
You were kickin'
ass back there.

106
00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:16.450
You made quite a scene.

107
00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:18.330
Huh? Wha...?!

108
00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:22.910
[gasps]

109
00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:29.000
<b>Jinbe, "Knight of the Sea"
Helmsman</b>
<b>Bounty: 1.1 Billion</b>

110
00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.110
[NARRATOR] Helmsman, First Son
of the Sea Jinbe.

111
00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:29.400
Bounty: 1 billion
100 million berries.

112
00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.440
[chuckles]

113
00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:37.720
<b>"Pirate Hunter" Zoro
Swordsman</b>
<b>Bounty: 1.111 Billion</b>

114
00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.820
[NARRATOR] Swordsman,
Pirate Hunter Zoro.

115
00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:37.470
Bounty: 1 billion
111 million berries.

116
00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.630
<b>1.032 Billion</b>
<b>1.1 Billion</b>
<b>1.111 Billion</b>

117
00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:38.940
Dammit!

118
00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.540
I'm lower than him?

119
00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.860
But how?

120
00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.670
<b>1.032 Billion</b>
<b>1.1 Billion</b>
<b>1.111 Billion</b>

121
00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.650
Are you all right, Sanji?

122
00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:45.060
You seem troubled.

123
00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:48.190
I do not need any
sympathy from you, Jinbe.

124
00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.950
You're both dead to me!

125
00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:50.900
[JINBE] Huh?

126
00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.730
<b>1.111 Billion</b>

127
00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.130
Nah, he's fine.

128
00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:52.910
Ignore him.

129
00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:55.610
He's just mad 'cause
he's number four.

130
00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.070
<b>1.111 Billion</b>

131
00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.320
[Zoro laughs]

132
00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.990
<b>1.111 Billion</b>

133
00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.090
Ah! What the hell did
you call me?

134
00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.270
[Sanji yells]

135
00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.640
[ZORO]
Show some respect to second place!

136
00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.440
[Jinbe gasps]

137
00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:03.360
[JINBE] Hey!

138
00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.190
Calm down!

139
00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.080
I won't do it again.

140
00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.890
Please let me out of here.

141
00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:18.460
<b>Emperor "Straw Hat" Luffy
Head Captain</b>
<b>Bounty: 3 Billion</b>

142
00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.780
[NARRATOR] Senior captain and an Emperor
of the Sea, Straw Hat Luffy.

143
00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:18.630
Bounty: 3 billion berries.

144
00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:19.700
[Zoro, Sanji shouting]

145
00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.510
[stomach growls]

146
00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.930
<b>Empty Bluffs Island</b>

147
00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:27.090
Did you see?

148
00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.490
[BUGGY PIRATE B]
Yeah, that was crazy!

149
00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:29.760
It was really them!

150
00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:30.970
[BUGGY PIRATE D] No way!

151
00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.700
They call him the world's
greatest swordsman, y'know!

152
00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:37.480
I'm scared!

153
00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:38.640
So cool!

154
00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.010
I thought we were finished
when the Navy shut

155
00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.880
down the Warlords
and came for our necks.

156
00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.430
But somehow, we're still here.

157
00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:51.390
We've got Buggy
to thank for that!

158
00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:53.160
Our Chairman is the best!

159
00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.170
What?

160
00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.190
Please, spare me!

161
00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.850
You can take whatever you
want from here, just let me go!

162
00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:07.510
Hey. Thank you!

163
00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:08.420
Come on!

164
00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.630
I'll do anything you say!

165
00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.810
<b>Emperor Buggy "the Bombastic Clown"</b>

166
00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:14.030
I'll lick your boots!
Just don't kill me!

167
00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.470
[Buggy groans]

168
00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.570
<b>Former Warlord Sir Crocodile</b>

169
00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:22.080
You know, when Hawkeye
and I founded Cross Guild,

170
00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.010
we were hopin'
to run it ourselves.

171
00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.700
<b>Former Warlord Dracule Mihawk</b>

172
00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.800
So tell me somethin', Buggy.

173
00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.560
Why are you the boss?

174
00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:32.430
Well, I mean, all I
can say is, I'm real sorry!

175
00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:34.160
Or, Better luck next time?

176
00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.950
And that's all it takes to be
an Emperor of the Sea?

177
00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.330
Some crying and
a half-hearted apology?

178
00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.980
Frankly, it sets a bad
example if we keep you alive.

179
00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.990
[Buggy screams]

180
00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:48.430
This is more than
just humiliation.

181
00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:52.220
A thousand deaths wouldn't pay
back the insult you've dealt me.

182
00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.230
I'll make it up to you!

183
00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.920
I'd rather you just die.

184
00:06:58.660 --> 00:06:59.720
Somebody!

185
00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:01.410
Help me!

186
00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.040
Somebody!
Somebody! Somebody!

187
00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:04.000
Well, look who it is!

188
00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:04.960
Hello, boss!

189
00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.820
Why, this is just like
the good old days, isn't it?

190
00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.290
<b>Galdino</b>
<b>Former Baroque Works Agent
(Crocodile's Subordinate)</b>

191
00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.280
It'll be so nice
working for you again!

192
00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.310
You worm!

193
00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.010
Stabbing me in the back!

194
00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:15.160
Huh, Galdino?

195
00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.250
Am I?

196
00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.890
Because I don't recall becoming
your subordinate, Buggy.

197
00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:21.670
[Buggy growls]

198
00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:24.040
[BUGGY]
Two-faced little prick!

199
00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.240
[Mr. 3 laughs]

200
00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:25.890
[MR. 3] Go ahead!

201
00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:27.380
Call me whatever you like!

202
00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:30.690
[MOHJI]
Welp, the Chairman is dead.

203
00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:31.660
So what now?

204
00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.890
You guys got a plan?

205
00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.680
I'm happy to serve Crocodile.

206
00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.820
[sighs] This is a dog-eat-dog
world we live in.

207
00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:42.670
[Mr. 3 laughs]

208
00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:44.050
Shame! Seems you pushed
your luck, Buggy boy!

209
00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:44.840
Dammit!

210
00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:47.300
[BUGGY]
I'm gonna bite your finger off!

211
00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.390
[Crocodile laughs]

212
00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:54.890
[CROCODILE] I hear you've lost your privilege
as a Warlord of the Sea, Mihawk.

213
00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:54.870
<b>Gloom Island</b>

214
00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:56.750
And what is your point?

215
00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.260
I'd make it quickly.

216
00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:02.150
As you may know, this island is
surrounded by the Navy right now.

217
00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:03.060
[CROCODILE] They move fast.

218
00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:09.110
Typical of the World Government to put
together a little committee just to pull

219
00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.480
the rug out from under you.

220
00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.970
I'm sure they were all proud
of themselves at the Reverie.

221
00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:15.670
But that's that.

222
00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.170
Now you're nothing
but a filthy pirate to them.

223
00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.960
They can't wait to cut you down
if it'll make them look better.

224
00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.790
You set them on the road
to this yourself.

225
00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.100
Mind your tongue.

226
00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.040
[CROCODILE]
That was a long time ago.

227
00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:34.380
[MIHAWK] If you're quite finished, I have
a rather urgent move to make.

228
00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:35.170
[CROCODILE] Good.

229
00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:36.750
Then why not come here?

230
00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.370
You don't have
a better plan, do you?

231
00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:44.740
If we team up together,
we can form an organization.

232
00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:46.420
The Navy will have to respect.

233
00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.620
You were known as the Marine
Hunter once upon a time.

234
00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:52.650
Neither of us trust
other people.

235
00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:55.270
We have that much
in common at least.

236
00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.640
It's not a bad deal, Hawkeye.

237
00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:05.710
[BUGGY]
What's with that look?

238
00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.200
What does he want?

239
00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.500
Why do bad things always happen to me?

240
00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:11.480
I've never done a thing wrong!

241
00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.910
[growls]

242
00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.140
[BUGGY PIRATE F]
You gotta come quick!

243
00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.260
Stop your crying!

244
00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.460
Go out and fight!

245
00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:20.130
You're not scared
of the Navy, are you?

246
00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.010
[BUGGY] Buzz off!

247
00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:24.850
I'm trying to sneak away
here, and you're ruining it!

248
00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:27.120
Somebody's attacking
the Navy ships!

249
00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.960
Look, they're all getting sunk!

250
00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.530
[BUGGY PIRATE F]
It's a massacre out there!

251
00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.860
[BUGGY]
But who would help us?

252
00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:41.970
[screams]

253
00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.040
This is scary!

254
00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.510
They're so strong!

255
00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:46.860
[BUGGY PIRATE F]
It's Crocodile!

256
00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:56.040
Get lost!

257
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.140
Open fire!

258
00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:11.740
Save us!

259
00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.130
[MARINES scream]

260
00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:21.510
I heard rumors that Crocodile
was Captain Buggy's henchman!

261
00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:22.980
I guess they're true!

262
00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:26.050
He's putting his life
on the line to rescue all of us!

263
00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:28.430
All thanks to Chairman Buggy!

264
00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.590
[Buggy pirates cheer]

265
00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:31.300
That's right!

266
00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.100
Just as I planned!

267
00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:38.710
[laughs]

268
00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:41.200
[BUGGY] He bailed my ass out before
and now he's coming to collect!

269
00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.800
I don't have that
kinda money!

270
00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:45.230
Why do you think I was
borrowing from you?

271
00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.570
I'd rather face the Navy!

272
00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.690
[CROCODILE]
Surprised you stuck around.

273
00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:56.770
I thought you'd
make a run for it.

274
00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:57.860
[Buggy groans]

275
00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.420
[BUGGY] I was trying to!

276
00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.200
[chuckles]

277
00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.820
Funny thing about business.

278
00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.350
It looks like I'm doing well,

279
00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.160
but there's just so
much overhead!

280
00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:08.160
So many mouths to feed!

281
00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:12.170
Also, my biggest earners were
the Giants and they all walked out.

282
00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:14.000
Oh, so you can't pay?

283
00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.370
Slavery it is, then.

284
00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:16.910
We'll sell you off today.

285
00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.010
Come on, Crocky-baby!

286
00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:21.980
We broke outta
Impel Down together.

287
00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:22.900
What about that?

288
00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:25.010
We're pals, right?

289
00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:28.150
Why do you think I lent you
the money in the first place?

290
00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:29.800
But that debt's been paid.

291
00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.090
Time for you to hold
up your end.

292
00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:32.970
Yeah, but...

293
00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.270
[CROCODILE]
I've got a company to fund.

294
00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:38.040
Now are you gonna pay
what you owe me, or not?

295
00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:39.440
Relax, okay?

296
00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.920
[growls]

297
00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:42.530
[BUGGY] How's this?

298
00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:45.300
I've got tons of experience.

299
00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:47.100
I'll help you run
your business!

300
00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.210
I'm a former Warlord
of the Sea, too!

301
00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.200
We'll make a perfect team!

302
00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:53.700
Really?

303
00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:57.050
I'll work off every
last berry I owe!

304
00:11:57.130 --> 00:12:01.830
For starters, I'll give your company
one hell of a flashy debut!

305
00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.560
I got human resources
out the wazoo!

306
00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.290
Advertising.

307
00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:07.590
Printing.

308
00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.080
Transportation.

309
00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:10.810
All at your fingertips!

310
00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:13.310
And the work is free of charge,
too!

311
00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:18.040
So, your genius idea
for a flyer was this?

312
00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:23.560
I can't help but notice
you're at the top, President.

313
00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:24.430
No.

314
00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:25.640
Wait a sec.

315
00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.430
That was an accident,
I promise you!

316
00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.390
[CROCODILE] Well, so is this.

317
00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:36.580
Listen!

318
00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:39.920
I swear that wasn't
my intention!

319
00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.750
This is all my staff's fault!

320
00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.180
They worship the ground
I walk on, okay?

321
00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.460
It took me by surprise, too!

322
00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:48.900
[laughs]

323
00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.480
Look at the poster I made!

324
00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:51.560
It's cool!

325
00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:52.780
It's cool, right?

326
00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.510
Agh! Damn it!

327
00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.190
What did you do?

328
00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.620
I made you look extra awesome,
'cause you're the best!

329
00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:01.650
[Buggy screams]

330
00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:06.790
You haven't shown
this to anyone yet, right?

331
00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.590
Nobody important, boss!

332
00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.800
Just everyone
in the whole world!

333
00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:15.720
[screams]

334
00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.580
[BRANDNEW]
As I'm sure you've heard,

335
00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:23.740
<b>Marine Headquarters</b>

336
00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.950
Buggy was the mastermind behind
the Impel Down prison break.

337
00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.480
He was even on Roger's
crew years ago.

338
00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:29.480
He and Red-Haired Shanks
share quite a bit of history,

339
00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.720
so he's no small fry.

340
00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:36.060
Also, he's so well-liked among pirates
that Crocodile came to his aid

341
00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:37.550
when we attacked
Emptee Bluffs Island.

342
00:13:37.550 --> 00:13:40.920
A partnership between Crocodile
and Mihawk was no surprise, though.

343
00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.230
We confirmed that
through wiretapping.

344
00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:48.010
Shady organizations are already
investing in their Marine hunting.

345
00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.280
We're seein' a rise in insurgency
all over the world right now.

346
00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.210
Cross Guild is feeding into it.

347
00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.810
We should consider
them a significant threat.

348
00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.660
What are the bounties
on Cross Guild's members?

349
00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:03.350
[BRANDNEW] First up, the former Warlord
of the Sea, Sir Crocodile!

350
00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:06.300
His logia-type devil fruit
power is still formidable.

351
00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.120
He also has a strong intellect
and leadership skills.

352
00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.710
His bounty is
1 billion 965 million berries!

353
00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:15.330
Then, Hawkeye Mihawk!

354
00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:19.520
The former Warlord is hailed as the world's
greatest swordsman, even above

355
00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.690
Red-Haired Shanks.

356
00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:25.150
A man with extraordinary strength
deserves an extraordinary bounty.

357
00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:27.790
3 billion 590 million berries!

358
00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:31.930
Lastly, there's Buggy
the Genius Jester!

359
00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.740
We spoke about
his storied history.

360
00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:38.790
But more than that, he commands
the power of the other two men.

361
00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:43.570
So his bounty is 3 billion
189 million berries!

362
00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:47.820
Just like Straw Hat Luffy,
we consider him to be a new Emperor.

363
00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:52.310
In other words, he is a threat
to the World Government itself!

364
00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.130
[CROCODILE] Look at you.

365
00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:56.410
An Emperor.

366
00:14:57.360 --> 00:15:01.150
That's quite the achievement...
for a clown.

367
00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:01.810
[BUGGY] I'm sorry!

368
00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:04.410
I'll lick your boots!

369
00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.040
So sorry!

370
00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:05.930
Did I say I'll lick your boots?

371
00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:06.900
That's enough.

372
00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.860
You know, this might
work out in our favor.

373
00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:15.050
Don't you think he'd be useful
as a figurehead for the guild?

374
00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:15.930
[BOTH] Huh?

375
00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:19.210
[MIHAWK] I have no interest
in becoming an Emperor.

376
00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:22.320
I'd much rather live in peace
and let him carry that target.

377
00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.100
On his back.

378
00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:24.950
You serious?

379
00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.580
We might as well let him
take the heat for a while.

380
00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:30.170
And if we change our minds,
we can kill him.

381
00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.210
[Buggy chuckles nervously]

382
00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.610
Fine by me.

383
00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:40.720
[Buggy pirates cheering]

384
00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.670
Our time is now!

385
00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:53.390
This era will require a new
vision and new leaders!

386
00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:56.000
We founded Cross
Guild to seize its reins!

387
00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:59.310
Allow me to introduce
our executives!

388
00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.320
First up...

389
00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.840
Sir Crocodile!

390
00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.020
[Buggy pirates cheer]

391
00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.600
[BUGGY] And next...

392
00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:12.660
The great swordsman,
Hawkeye Mihawk!

393
00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.820
[BUGGY PIRATE R] Crocodile!

394
00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:17.840
[Buggy pirates cheer]

395
00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:21.660
Looks like we're back!

396
00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:23.840
Boss! You're the best!

397
00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:27.120
We do it right
and do it flashy.

398
00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.180
What d'you say?

399
00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:35.460
[Buggy pirates shouting]

400
00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:36.110
Look!

401
00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.200
He's sheddin' tears of joy!

402
00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.420
Aw, dang it all!

403
00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:43.740
Now I'm gonna
start cryin', too!

404
00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:47.580
[BUGGY]
I have lost control of my life.

405
00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:50.030
<b>Near Sphinx,
Whitebeard's Homeland

New World</b>

406
00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:56.130
I see it, Marco.

407
00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.070
We're here.

408
00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:58.010
Yeah?

409
00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.700
Alright, I'll be taking off now.

410
00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.580
Thanks for the ride.

411
00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:05.450
It was fun.

412
00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:06.950
Bye, Shanks.

413
00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.110
[SHANKS] You're leaving?

414
00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:10.440
You sure you don't wanna
join my crew, Marco?

415
00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:11.310
Come on.

416
00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.000
[laughs]
Thanks, but no thanks!

417
00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.630
You bigshot pirates
are too much!

418
00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:23.780
No more babysitting for me!

419
00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:25.520
[SHANKS] Gimme a break!

420
00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.350
I'm not that
high maintenance!

421
00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:28.250
Tell him, Beck!

422
00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.370
[BECKMAN]
You want me to lie?

423
00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:30.160
[Shanks grunts]

424
00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:30.150
Ugh!

425
00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:33.290
[both laugh]

426
00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:31.320
Hahahaha!

427
00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:34.910
See ya!

428
00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.120
<b>A Short

 While Ago

 In Wano</b>

429
00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.200
[LUFFY] What?

430
00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.030
You're not gonna
come with us?

431
00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:55.120
We were gonna be
pirates together!

432
00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.990
Yamato, no!

433
00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:00.990
I can't imagine
a life without you!

434
00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:04.020
Just think of all the sweet
memories we could make!

435
00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:08.320
Why? Why? Why? Why?

436
00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.310
You felt what happened
back there, didn't you?

437
00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:13.040
When that
woods man attacked?

438
00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:17.470
We were on the verge of defeat when
someone's haki saved this country.

439
00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:20.560
Kaido is gone, but other
enemies will target us.

440
00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:22.760
And now that I know that...

441
00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:26.290
I'd go crazy if I left!

442
00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:30.450
I can't have a fun adventure while I'm
worried about my friends at home!

443
00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.270
You'd feel the same
way, right?

444
00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.010
But I still wanna be
a part of your crew!

445
00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.240
Make me
an honorary member!

446
00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:40.760
[LUFFY]
Hmm. I guess I understand.

447
00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:48.850
[LUFFY]
That might be good, actually.

448
00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:53.120
If you stay in the Land of Wano,
it'll be in good hands.

449
00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.560
I'll leave it to you!

450
00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.060
Keep Momo safe!

451
00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.150
Hmph!

452
00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:03.200
It won't be easy.

453
00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.350
Momo has a lot
of pride, you know.

454
00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:06.870
He might be stubborn.

455
00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.040
I am, too!

456
00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.190
Don't worry about me.

457
00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:10.290
I can handle this.

458
00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.650
[SANJI] Yamato... no.

459
00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:16.020
[MARCO] Hey, Straw Hat!

460
00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:18.920
Hey, Marco!

461
00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.450
[MARCO] There's a ship nearby that's goin'
my way, so I'm takin' off.

462
00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:24.140
It's been a real adventure!

463
00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.380
[LUFFY] Sure has!

464
00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:26.370
Have a safe trip!

465
00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.400
You too!

466
00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:31.260
I wanted to ask.

467
00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:33.020
Back in Marineford.

468
00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:35.650
You saved my life
during that battle, right?

469
00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:38.070
Carry Straw Hat
if you won't run!

470
00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:39.430
Hurry!

471
00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:40.620
Thanks for that!

472
00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.530
Everyone was working
hard to save you.

473
00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:44.840
Jinbe, too.

474
00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:45.890
Why was that?

475
00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:48.750
Ah, well, it's been
quite a while.

476
00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:49.990
[yells]

477
00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.120
Can't say I recall.

478
00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:52.610
[laughs]

479
00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:55.820
You've come a long
way since then.

480
00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:54.110
[chuckles]

481
00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.250
I'm sure Ace would be
real proud of you.

482
00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.760
[chuckles]

483
00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:04.940
I sure hope so!

484
00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:09.780
[MARCO] Luffy!

485
00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.080
This age belongs to you now!

486
00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.610
Better take good care of it!

487
00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.020
[Marco laughs]

488
00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:19.590
Right!

489
00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:20.500
See ya!

490
00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.460
Please, sweetie.

491
00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.210
Don't be so hard on yourself.

492
00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.730
He's fine!

493
00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:39.640
Huh?

494
00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.400
It's Sabo!

495
00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.190
He'll make it back soon!

496
00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:44.210
Right.

497
00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:47.220
On the bright side, at least
everyone survived the mission.

498
00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.500
There ya go!

499
00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:49.640
<b>Kamabakka Queendom
Grand Line</b>

500
00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:51.160
We have to celebrate
every little miracle!

501
00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:50.560
[chuckles]

502
00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:51.940
Heehaw!

503
00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:55.150
[MORLEY] But golly gee.

504
00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.610
That darn Sabo!

505
00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.880
How dare he make
us worry so much?

506
00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.250
My little heart can't
take all of this!

507
00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:05.340
[KARASU] I wish I knew what happened,
but we were already split up by then.

508
00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:07.750
Still, I believe in Sabo.

509
00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:09.030
Hey, that's my line!

510
00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:11.070
I believed in Sabo
way before you did!

511
00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:13.440
In fact, my hopes
for him are sky high!

512
00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:19.150
Would you shut up?

513
00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:21.660
We're an army,
not a damned circus.

514
00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:33.660
Dragon.

515
00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:39.320
Sabo will be all right.

516
00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:47.960
However, if he really killed King Cobra,
that's not something I can ever approve of.

517
00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:50.330
It doesn't matter
what the reason is.

518
00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:52.590
It's unacceptable.

519
00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.790
Now, Kuma.

520
00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:05.590
We've done enough
speculating.

521
00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:08.150
Why don't you tell
me what you saw?

522
00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:14.680
As you wish, Master.

523
00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:15.460
Master...

524
00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:19.460
As you wish.

525
00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:38.840
[transponder snail B ringing]

526
00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:41.910
We've got an incoming call
to the Kamabakka Queendom!

527
00:22:41.990 --> 00:22:43.930
[MARINE OFFICER B] It could be
the Flame Emperor!

528
00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:43.760
<b>Marine Headquarters
New World</b>

529
00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:44.810
Trace it!

530
00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:46.520
And record the call!

531
00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:47.300
Yes, sir!

532
00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:53.140
[transponder snail B ringing]

533
00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.230
[KOALA] Everyone, quiet!

534
00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:58.200
[transponder snail A ringing]

535
00:22:57.150 --> 00:22:57.990
[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A]
Cu-lick.

536
00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:02.390
Hello?

537
00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:04.580
This is Koala.

538
00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:07.200
[SABO] It's me.

539
00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:10.190
It's Sabo.

540
00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:11.010
[Ivankov, Morley gasp]

541
00:23:13.150 --> 00:23:14.250
I'm sorry.

542
00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:17.940
I know I've caused
you guys trouble.
